<item>
  <title>2027 Türkiye Bilim İletişimi Zirvesi Ev Sahipliği Başvuruları Başladı!</title>
  <link>http://bilimgenc.tubitak.gov.tr/makale/2027-turkiye-bilim-iletisimi-zirvesi-ev-sahipligi-basvurulari-basladi</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;2027 Türkiye Bilim İletişimi Zirvesi Ev Sahipliği Başvuruları Başladı!&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-kose field--type-entity-reference field--label-inline clearfix"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Köşe&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;a href="http://bilimgenc.tubitak.gov.tr/koselerimiz/duyurular" hreflang="tr"&gt;Duyurular&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class="field field--name-uid field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;span lang about="http://bilimgenc.tubitak.gov.tr/users/rizaaycelebi" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype&gt;riza.aycelebi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;time datetime="2026-10-16T09:26:55+03:00" title="Cuma, Ekim 16, 2026 - 09:26 [+03:0009+03:00 31ööFri, 16 Oct 2026 09:26:55 +03002609 b26ç261026]" class="datetime"&gt;Cu, 10/16/2026 - 09:26&lt;/time&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-tags field--type-entity-reference field--label-inline clearfix"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Konu&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div class="field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;a href="http://bilimgenc.tubitak.gov.tr/konular/bilim-iletisimi" hreflang="tr"&gt;Bilim İletişimi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;a href="http://bilimgenc.tubitak.gov.tr/konular/tubitak" hreflang="tr"&gt;TÜBİTAK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-yazar field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Bilim Genç&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-makale-gorseli field--type-image field--label-inline clearfix"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Makale Görseli&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div class="field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;/sites/default/files/styles/bp-770px-custom_user_desktop_1x/public/bilim-iletisimi-zirvesi-basvurulari-2027.webp?itok=BmbUIC7P&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"&gt;TÜBİTAK yürütücülüğünde, Orta Doğu Teknik Üniversitesi (ODTÜ) ev sahipliğinde 14–15 Ekim 2026 tarihlerinde Ankara’da gerçekleştirilen Türkiye Bilim İletişimi Zirvesi, 2027 yılında farklı bir üniversitenin ev sahipliğinde düzenlenecek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bilim insanlarını, bilim iletişimcilerini, eğitimcileri ve farklı kurumların temsilcilerini bir araya getiren zirve, bilim iletişimi alanındaki deneyimlerin paylaşılmasına ve kurumlar arasındaki iş birliğinin geliştirilmesine katkı sağlıyor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2027 Türkiye Bilim İletişimi Zirvesi’ne ev sahipliği yapmak isteyen üniversiteler, başvuru koşullarını inceleyerek 31 Aralık 2026 tarihine kadar çevrim içi başvuru formunu doldurabilir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id="zirve2027-basvuru"&gt;
&lt;div class="z27-info"&gt;&lt;span class="z27-badge"&gt;BAŞVURULAR AÇIK&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong class="z27-title"&gt;2027 Türkiye Bilim İletişimi Zirvesi&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class="z27-desc"&gt;Ev sahipliği başvuruları: 16 Ekim–31 Aralık 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="z27-action"&gt;
&lt;div aria-label="Başvuruların kapanmasına kalan süre" class="z27-counter" role="timer"&gt;
&lt;div class="z27-unit"&gt;&lt;b data-z27="days"&gt;—&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Gün&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="z27-unit"&gt;&lt;b data-z27="hours"&gt;—&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Saat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="z27-unit"&gt;&lt;b data-z27="minutes"&gt;—&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Dakika&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="z27-unit"&gt;&lt;b data-z27="seconds"&gt;—&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span&gt;Saniye&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="z27-button" href="https://bilimgenc.tubitak.gov.tr/bilim-iletisimi-zirvesi-talep-formu" style="color:white!important"&gt;Başvuru Yap &lt;span aria-hidden="true"&gt;↗&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;style type="text/css"&gt;#zirve2027-basvuru,
  #zirve2027-basvuru * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid #dce8ef;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(115deg, #f0f7fb, #ffffff);
    color: #15334a;
    font-family: inherit;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(21, 51, 74, .05);
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-info {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 280px;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #e1f3e9;
    color: #176b42;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .7px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-title {
    display: block;
    margin: 0;
    color: #15334a;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-desc {
    color: #526878;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-action {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-counter {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-unit {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 49px;
    padding: 7px 6px;
    border: 1px solid #e1eaf0;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #fff;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-unit b {
    color: #15334a;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-unit span {
    margin-top: 3px;
    color: #607484;
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru a.z27-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 11px 18px;
    border: 1px solid #176b8c;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #176b8c;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: none;
    transition: background .2s;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru a.z27-button:hover {
    border-color: #10516c;
    background: #10516c;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru a.z27-button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #edac42;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-status {
    color: #526878;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    #zirve2027-basvuru {
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-action {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    #zirve2027-basvuru .z27-title {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;script&gt;
(function () {
  var root = document.getElementById("zirve2027-basvuru");
  if (!root || root.dataset.z27Ready) return;
  root.dataset.z27Ready = "true";

  var start = Date.parse("2026-10-16T00:00:00+03:00");
  var end = Date.parse("2027-01-01T00:00:00+03:00");
  var badge = root.querySelector(".z27-badge");
  var counter = root.querySelector(".z27-counter");
  var button = root.querySelector(".z27-button");
  var timer;

  function update() {
    var now = Date.now();
    var beforeStart = now &lt; start;
    var remaining = Math.max(0, Math.floor(
      ((beforeStart ? start : end) - now) / 1000
    ));

    if (now &gt;= end) {
      badge.textContent = "BAŞVURULAR SONA ERDİ";
      counter.removeAttribute("role");
      counter.removeAttribute("aria-label");
      counter.className = "z27-status";
      counter.textContent = "Başvuru süresi dolmuştur.";
      button.textContent = "Başvuru Bilgileri ↗";
      if (timer) clearInterval(timer);
      return;
    }

    badge.textContent = beforeStart
      ? "BAŞVURULAR 16 EKİM’DE BAŞLIYOR"
      : "BAŞVURULAR AÇIK";

    counter.setAttribute("aria-label", beforeStart
      ? "Başvuruların başlamasına kalan süre"
      : "Başvuruların kapanmasına kalan süre");

    button.textContent = beforeStart
      ? "Başvuru Koşulları ↗"
      : "Başvuru Yap ↗";

    var values = {
      days: Math.floor(remaining / 86400),
      hours: Math.floor(remaining % 86400 / 3600),
      minutes: Math.floor(remaining % 3600 / 60),
      seconds: remaining % 60
    };

    Object.keys(values).forEach(function (key) {
      root.querySelector('[data-z27="' + key + '"]').textContent =
        String(values[key]).padStart(2, "0");
    });
  }

  update();
  if (Date.now() &lt; end) timer = setInterval(update, 1000);
})();
&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
